,boss_phase_archmagus_p2_banner:"阶段 II · 弹幕",boss_phase_archmagus_p2_toast:"「躲开紫球 — 靠近才能弹反！」",boss_phase_archmagus_p3_banner:"阶段 III · 禁咒",boss_phase_archmagus_p3_toast:"「最后一页，不允许被读到！」",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p1_banner:"阶段 I · 引力井",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p1_toast:"「质量即命运。你逃不掉。」",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p2_banner:"阶段 II · 拉扯",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p2_toast:"「感受奇点 — 别被拉进中心！」",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p3_banner:"阶段 III · 轨道弹幕",boss_phase_singularity_herald_p3_toast:"「六条轨道，六条死路。」",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p1_banner:"阶段 I · 时线",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p1_toast:"「你读这句话时，另一个你已经倒下。」",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p2_banner:"阶段 II · 时停",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p2_toast:"「时间在此折叠 — 蓄力法术可打断！」",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p3_banner:"阶段 III · 终刻",boss_phase_void_chronarch_p3_toast:"「所有时线归一 — 唯有斩裂。」",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p1_banner:"阶段 I · 裂隙",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p1_toast:"「四界归一，裂隙仍存。」",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p2_banner:"阶段 II · 混沌脉冲",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p2_toast:"「靠近我会被混沌灼烧 — 保持距离！」",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p3_banner:"阶段 III · 终焉",boss_phase_chaos_overlord_p3_toast:"「斩裂我，或成为下一个裂隙。」",boss_defeat_shadow_warden_text:"影散。灰白森林的第一道枷锁解除。\\n\\n营火可解锁「影界斩」剑系技能。",boss_defeat_archmagus_text:"禁书合上。霍格沃兹遗境的奥术风暴平息。\\n\\n杖系「奥术共鸣 II」已在营火可用。",boss_defeat_singularity_herald_text:"引力井坍缩。米勒荒原恢复静止。\\n\\n剑系「位面斩强化」已解锁。",boss_defeat_void_chronarch_text:"时线重新缝合。你看见无数个自己的倒影消散。\\n\\n杖系「时线洞察」已解锁。",boss_defeat_chaos_overlord_text:"混沌暂退。边境的闪电归于沉默。\\n\\n双流派终极技能「无尽行者」已解锁。",boss_dungeon_ruin_crypt_intro:"遗城守墓者从碑刻中站起。",boss_dungeon_ruin_crypt_p2:"守墓者唤醒遗城亡魂 — 更快，更狠。",boss_dungeon_ruin_crypt_defeat:"墓穴归于寂静。锚点碎片在墙后显露。",boss_dungeon_forbidden_library_intro:"禁书守页人合成万卷之名。",boss_dungeon_forbidden_library_p2:"最后一页开始燃烧 — 守页人暴走。",boss_dungeon_forbidden_library_defeat:"禁书合上。图书馆的灾难被推迟。",boss_dungeon_five_dim_rift_intro:"裂隙监工从五维投影中降临。",boss_dungeon_five_dim_rift_p2:"几何扭曲 — 监工进入猎杀模式。",boss_dungeon_five_dim_rift_defeat:"投影消散。裂隙观测站恢复信号。",boss_dungeon_forest_shrine_intro:"神龛古树的根须化为守钥者。",boss_dungeon_forest_shrine_p2:"根须缠绕 — 守钥者进入第二阶段。",boss_dungeon_forest_shrine_defeat:"上一个纪元的记忆随风散去。",boss_dungeon_hub_catacombs_intro:"枢纽守钥者从墓穴最深处苏醒。",boss_dungeon_hub_catacombs_p2:"守钥者拔出枢纽之钥 — 迷宫震动。",boss_dungeon_hub_catacombs_defeat:"守钥者倒下。枢纽地下再次封闭。",boss_dungeon_phase1_banner:"守钥者 · 第一阶段",boss_dungeon_phase2_banner:"守钥者 · 第二阶段",boss_dungeon_defeat_banner:"守钥者已倒",boss_dungeon_void_broken_casket_intro:"匣盖弹开的一瞬，里面那只钟仍在走。",boss_dungeon_void_broken_casket_p2:"钟声快了 — 匣里的影子开始重叠。",boss_dungeon_void_broken_casket_p3:"匣壁开始收缩 — 守钥者从缝隙里挤了出来。",boss_dungeon_void_broken_casket_defeat:"钟停了。匣盖合上，里面只剩一段断掉的刻度。",boss_dungeon_abyss_deep_maw_intro:"地底传来碾磨声 — 深渊的颚张开了。",boss_dungeon_abyss_deep_maw_p2:"颚合了一半 — 守钥者的牙在磨。",boss_dungeon_abyss_deep_maw_p3:"整条边境在往里塌 — 守钥者咽下了最后一口气。",boss_dungeon_abyss_deep_maw_defeat:"地底安静了。颚骨卡在岩层里，没合上。",boss_dungeon_sunless_oratory_intro:"长椅空着 — 守夜人从最后一排走过来。",boss_dungeon_sunless_oratory_p2:"灯架倒了一半 — 它把灭掉的烛芯挨个吹亮。",boss_dungeon_sunless_oratory_p3:"中殿穹顶裂开一道缝，光进不来 — 守夜人站到了缝底下。",boss_dungeon_sunless_oratory_defeat:"守夜人跪回最后一排。灯还是没点，但祷堂安静了。",boss_phase_fallback_banner:"阶段 ${phase}",boss_phase_fallback_toast:"Boss 第 ${phase} 阶段！",sem_label_danger:"危险",sem_label_warning:"警告",sem_label_safe:"恢复",sem_label_resource:"资源",sem_label_threat:"威胁",sem_label_posture:"架势",sem_label_rarity_common:"凡品",sem_label_rarity_uncommon:"良品",sem_label_rarity_rare:"稀有",sem_label_rarity_epic:"史诗",sem_cv_default:"默认",sem_cv_deuteranopia:"红绿色盲",sem_cv_protanopia:"红色盲",sem_cv_tritanopia:"蓝黄色盲",enemy_name_dummy:"训练木人",enemy_name_summon:"虚空仆从",enemy_name_soldier:"影之战士",enemy_name_golem:"魔法构装体",enemy_name_drone:"轨道无人机",enemy_name_elite:"精英·虚空骑士",enemy_name_wraith:"时线怨影",enemy_name_stalker:"混沌掠行兽",enemy_name_sentinel:"边境哨炮",enemy_name_crawler:"虚空爬兽",enemy_name_knight:"深渊骑士",enemy_name_dancer:"刃舞者",enemy_name_juggernaut:"破阵重兵",enemy_name_hexer:"位面咒师",enemy_name_gloom_wraith:"幽暗怨影",enemy_name_gloom_stalker:"幽暗掠行兽",enemy_name_gloom_sentinel:"幽暗哨卫",enemy_name_gloom_warden:"幽暗守夜人",enemy_name_gloo